# Security

Never trust from the client:

- Price, inventory quantity, compatibility result
- User role / permissions
- Payment / order paid status

## Required patterns

- JWT + refresh tokens; secure cookies where applicable
- Password hashing; email verification
- RBAC on admin and sensitive mutations
- Rate limiting; GraphQL validation + query depth limits
- Stripe webhook signature validation
- Input validation on every mutation
- Audit log for admin-critical actions

## Secrets

Use env vars only. Never commit `.env`. Keep `.env.example` in sync.

